            %li#Lurie
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , Section A.2.9 in
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"} Higher Topos Theory
                (2009)
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emily+Riehl"}> Emily Riehl
                , Chapter 14 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categorical+Homotopy+Theory"} Categorical Homotopy Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781107261457"} doi:10.1017/CBO9781107261457
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.jhu.edu/~eriehl/cathtpy.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            An overview stressing the role of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weighted+colimit"} weighted colimits
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emily+Riehl"}> Emily Riehl
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Verity"} Dominic Verity
              = succeed "," do
                %em The theory and practice of Reedy categories
              %strong 29
              9 (2014) 256-301 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/29/9/29-09abs.html"}> tac:29-09
              ,
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1304.6871"}> arXiv:1304.6871
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Discussion of functoriality of Reedy model structures:
          %ul
            %li#Barwick
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Clark+Barwick"}> Clark Barwick
              ,
              %em On Reedy Model Categories
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0708.2832"}> arXiv:0708.2832
              )
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+model+category"} enriched
          %ul
            %li#Angeltveit
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vigleik+Angeltveit"}> Vigleik Angeltveit
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Enriched Reedy categories
              %strong 136
              7 (2008) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0612137"}> arXiv:math/0612137
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/journals/proc/2008-136-07/S0002-9939-08-09185-5/home.html"} AMS:S0002-9939-08-09185-5
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/20535419"} jstor:20535419
          %p
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+model+category"} monoidal
            Reedy model structures:
          %ul
            %li
              Moncef Ghazel, Fethi Kadhi,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Reedy diagrams in V-model categories
              %strong 27
              (2019) 549–566 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1610.06535"}> arXiv:1610.06535
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s10485-019-09566-w"} doi:10.1007/s10485-019-09566-w
          %p Discussion of fibrant generation of Reedy model structure:
          %ul
            %li#BHKKRS15
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marzieh+Bayeh"}> Marzieh Bayeh
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kathryn+Hess"} Kathryn Hess
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varvara+Karpova"} Varvara Karpova
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Magdalena+Kedziorek"} Magdalena Kedziorek
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emily+Riehl"} Emily Riehl
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brooke+Shipley"} Brooke Shipley
              = succeed "," do
                %em Left-induced model structures and diagram categories
              = succeed "," do
                %em Women in Topology: Collaborations in Homotopy Theory
              %strong 641
